      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_04a",
      "hash64": "44B2ED496F004C6A",
      "text": "With its boss out of the picture, the Segin Squad\\nis pretty much done for.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
