      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "team_0090_system_02",
      "hash64": "CEB959DBE0C2FF1B",
      "text": "You earned 10,000 LP!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "team_0090_system_03",
      "hash64": "CEB958DBE0C2FD68",
      "text": "You can now make more kinds of TMs using the\\nTM Machine!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_18",
      "hash64": "4099446F65777102",
      "text": "Make good use of those TMs. They should help\\nyou take down the last remaining boss.\\c\\nMy supply unit rep will be along soon to give\\nyou your bonus reward.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
